{"product_id":"we-meet-again","title":"We meet again","description":"\u003cp\u003eHis name is Failure, Timmy Failure. His detective agency is on the verge of global domination. Global riches. Global fame. In this, the third volume of his memoirs, Timmy Failure will reveal how he will triumph over the curveballs of the gods: for starters, academic probation. The coveted Miracle Report is the key to everything, including a good grade. It’s dirty business. It’s best you know nothing.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:20 x 198  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Stephan Pastis \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781406363715 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44285548101785,"sku":"4RB9781406363715","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/78caf4806fbae615b2d212ebb5516d98.jpg?v=1752150816","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/we-meet-again","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}